      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Opening Day is the day on which professional baseball leagues begin their regular season. For Major League Baseball and most of the minor leagues, this day typically falls during the first week of April.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
